{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01211","headline":"相和歌辞 苦哉行五首 四 · 戎昱","name":"相和歌辞 苦哉行五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾家青河边，七叶承貂蝉。\n身爲最小女，偏得浑家怜。\n亲戚不相识，幽闺十五年。\n有时最远出，祗到中门前。\n前年狂胡来，惧死飜生全。\n今秋官军至，岂意遭戈鋋。\n匈奴爲先锋，长鼻黄发拳。\n弯弓猎生人，百步牛羊羶。\n脱身落虎口，不及归黄泉。\n苦哉难重陈，暗哭苍苍天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}